                    </div>

                    <div class="card" style="margin-top:25px; padding:20px; background:#1e293b;">
                        <h3 style="margin-top:0; border-bottom:1px solid #334155; padding-bottom:10px; font-size:1rem; color:#f1f5f9;"><i class="fas fa-sliders-h"></i> 传感器及算法精细调节面板</h3>
                        <div class="settings-grid">
                            
                            <div class="setting-item">
                                <div>
